    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2> Each enemy in Unreality has a characteristic color and a unique movement, forming shapes and patterns that are challenging to overcome, adding a strategic element to your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/b5ebc2f8e33b8d8399f0e6ff7d95a054.poster.avif?t=1720332494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/b5ebc2f8e33b8d8399f0e6ff7d95a054.webm?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/b5ebc2f8e33b8d8399f0e6ff7d95a054.mp4?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels and Lives</h2> Each chapter features three levels, totaling 15 levels. Throughout your adventure, you will have three lives per level and a strategic checkpoint midway through the course. But beware! If you lose all three lives, you will be forced to restart the level from the beginning. Unreality's retro style will transport you to a visually captivating universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/8178a049aba6a4968a732ec5a2640175.poster.avif?t=1720332494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/8178a049aba6a4968a732ec5a2640175.webm?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/8178a049aba6a4968a732ec5a2640175.mp4?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Difficulty </h2> Precision in jumps and reaction time will be key to overcoming the challenges that await you. With three difficulty modes, Unreality offers you the opportunity to customize your gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/a62bf9b92acd43bdade7d2cfbec7f62c.poster.avif?t=1720332494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/a62bf9b92acd43bdade7d2cfbec7f62c.webm?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/a62bf9b92acd43bdade7d2cfbec7f62c.mp4?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shield</h2> For those moments when the difficulty intensifies, the shield will come to your aid. If you face insurmountable obstacles in a specific area, the shield will allow you to progress without losing the magic of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/ea189bdc5be7383797affc7c251d0c77.poster.avif?t=1720332494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/ea189bdc5be7383797affc7c251d0c77.webm?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765850/extras/ea189bdc5be7383797affc7c251d0c77.mp4?t=1720332494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere and Soundtrack</h2> The spatial ambiance of Unreality is unique, as all galaxy and cluster images are real captures from NASA's Hubble and Chandra space telescopes. Immerse yourself in the beauty of the cosmos as you overcome each level. The musical atmosphere, featuring compositions by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio, will accompany you in every jump and challenge, further immersing you in the Unreality experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Gamepad</h2> Accessibility is a priority in Unreality, as it is compatible with most generic gamepads. The game features a custom mapping system to adapt to each controller. Additionally, gamepad options are fully adjustable, allowing you to change jump and movement buttons to facilitate one-handed gameplay, especially designed for players with this condition.<br><br><strong>Get ready to explore, jump, and face challenges in this thrilling world. Are you ready for the adventure in Unreality? Let the intergalactic journey begin!</strong>",
